SUMMARY:Deadline: Smartwear Revolution Artist-in-Residence 2027 (University
  of Alberta): In-Person and Virtual Residencies
DESCRIPTION:Two artist residencies with Co-Designing a Smartwear Revolution
 \, a University of Alberta research network of 100+ researchers in textile
  science\, AI and robotics building smart garments with sensors and actuat
 ors. The in-person resident gets lab and studio access in Edmonton\; the v
 irtual resident works remotely.\n\nOrganisation: Co-Designing a Smartwear 
 Revolution\, University of Alberta (Art & Design Working Group)\, funded b
 y the New Frontiers in Research Fund\nLocation: Edmonton\, Alberta\, Canad
 a (one in-person residency) or virtual (one residency). Open international
 ly.\nAward: In-person: CAD 12\,000 covering artist fee\, materials\, trave
 l\, accommodation and production. Virtual: CAD 8\,000 covering materials a
 nd production. Stage-2 interviewees receive a CAD 100 honorarium. No appli
 cation fee.\nDuration: In-person May to June 2027\; virtual flexible betwe
 en February and December 2027\n\nMore: https://smartwearrevolution.com/air
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
